1	//! Model-free integration tests for the unified batched sampler.
2	//!
3	//! Synthetic logits arenas (no model weights): each test pins down one behaviour
4	//! the crate adds on top of the raw kernels — greedy/non-greedy routing, per-row
5	//! token placement, scratch reuse, and the capacity invariant. Raw kernel
6	//! correctness (top-k/top-p/temperature, philox determinism) is owned by
7	//! `pegainfer-kernels`; here we check that the door wires rows to the right path
8	//! and lands each token at the right index. Requires a GPU.
9	
10	use std::collections::HashSet;
11	
12	use half::bf16;
13	use pegainfer_kernels::tensor::DeviceContext;
14	use pegainfer_kernels::tensor::HiddenStates;
15	use pegainfer_sample::SampleScratch;
16	use pegainfer_sample::SamplingParams;
17	use pegainfer_sample::select_batch;
