832	/// top-1 is written exactly like [`markov_step_argmax_into`]'s output (the
833	/// ping-pong `output` plus the `sampled_tokens` stamp), so a branch step needs
834	/// no separate argmax pass; the runner-up lands in `out_top2` — the
835	/// speculative hedge's branch source.
