43	// small-batch x large-vocab decode regime), then one FlashInfer sampling kernel
44	// (Sampling/TopP/TopKTopP depending on the row params). One philox seed per
45	// call; rows decorrelate through the philox subsequence (= row index), so the
46	// caller must supply a fresh seed per decode step.
